{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Let us put men and women together
[G]To see which one is [D]smarter
[D]Some say the men but I say no,
The [D]women got the men like a [G]puppet show
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
It ain't [G]me, it's the people who say
Men are leading the women [D]astray
I [D]say it's the women today
Smarter than the man in [G]every way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
That's [G]right the women are smarter,
That's [G]right the women are [D]smarter,
That's [D]right the women are smarter,
The [D]women are smarter, that's [G]right.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Little boy sit on the corner and cry,
Big man come and ask him why
He say I can't do what the big boys do,
The man sat down and he cried too.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
Ever since the world began,
Women been mendin' the ways of man,
Listen boys, cause I got a plan,
Give it up, don't try to understand.
{end_of_verse}
